| `Get-ChildItem` + `Select-String` (content search) | `Grep` `files_with_matches` | 0 |
| OSS / machine-path / identity scrub (home paths, emails, secrets, CFG- IDs in public trees) | Editor **Grep** or shell `rg` per [spine-public-release-redaction-checklist.md](../docs/oss/spine-public-release-redaction-checklist.md) §3; for `.ps1` policy abs-path smells also **`pwsh -NoProfile -File scripts/Invoke-WorkspacePsPolicyAudit.ps1 -RepoRoot <repo> -AgentSummary`** (complementary — not a substitute for §3) | 0–1 |
| `Get-ChildItem` (name/pattern search) | `Glob`; recursive stats → **`pwsh -NoProfile -File scripts/Invoke-RepoFolderStats.ps1`** | 0 |
| `Get-Content` / `cat` / `head` / `tail` | `Read` (with `offset`/`limit`); backlog/stats → **`pwsh -NoProfile -File scripts/Invoke-BacklogStats.ps1`** | 0 |
| `Get-ChildItem` + `Measure-Object` / line counts on `docs/` | **`pwsh -NoProfile -File scripts/Invoke-MarkdownLineStats.ps1`** or **`Invoke-RepoFolderStats.ps1`** | 0 |
